ave I… how much have I actually spent in number 44 flat?\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in number 44 flat, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0022\", \"v\": [[\"We're doing a bit of a money catch-up at the flat this week, so could you show me what I've been spending on in number 44 flat?\", \"Okay, that's quite a list, what do all of those come to added together?\", \"Hmm, I don't remember that saxophone one being shared, which group is it actually filed under?\", \"Right, and remind me who's in that group, because I've lost track of who moved in?\", \"And just so I have it straight for the chat, how many people is that altogether?\"], [\"number 44 flat expenses\", \"total of those?\", \"saxophone one, which group?\", \"who's in it?\", \"how many total?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0023\", \"v\": [[\"show me the pics in the Wyvgeholm 2026 album\", \"hang on who do i owe money to rn\", \"ok back to the wyvgeholm pics, can u put the fourth one in the Café Vunnow album too\"], [\"Wyvgeholm 2026 album photos\", \"wait, who do I owe?\", \"back to those, fourth into Café Vunnow album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0024\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to figure out where my money's been going this month, so could you show me which expenses came in over 25 naira?\", \"Oh, different thing, I think I deleted my chandelier note by accident yesterday, can you restore it?\"], [\"expenses over 25 naira\", \"undelete chandelier note\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0025\", \"v\": [[\"me vs Vranir Gauthier in number 44 flat?\", \"and Grerra?\", \"look up Drulleo Joinery\"], [\"We're settling up the bills soon, so where do I stand with Vranir Gauthier in number 44 flat at the moment?\", \"Okay, and what about Grerra, since I'll need to sort things with them too?\", \"Right, separate thing, I need to get someone round about the cupboards, can you look up Drulleo Joinery for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0026\", \"v\": [[\"can u add the attic picture to the Viola album pls\"], [\"umm could you… yeah, stick the attic picture in the Viola album?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0027\", \"v\": [[\"jot down a note measure the saxophone\", \"whats my earliest thing on sunday\", \"who's invited to the electrician\", \"whats the latest pic i took\"], [\"Could you please jot down a note that says measure the saxophone?\", \"Also, would you tell me what my earliest appointment is on Sunday?\", \"Could you let me know who's invited to the electrician appointment?\", \"One more thing, what's the most recent photo I've taken, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0028\", \"v\": [[\"uh, can you delete the… the fencing photo, please?\", \"oh and um when's the cricket thing again?\"], [\"delete fencing photo\", \"when's the cricket?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0029\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the poppy photo for me?\", \"On another note, would you check whether anyone owes me money?\", \"Thank you. Could you also tell me which steps of ask vranir I've already finished?\"], [\"umm yeah, can you delete the poppy photo?\", \"oh and does anyone… is anyone owing me cash at the moment?\", \"ok and umm which bits of ask vranir have I, like, done already?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0030\", \"v\": [[\"Could you open the Summer 2026 album for me, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment, could you tell me when the cricket viewing is?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the album, would you narrow that down to anything about viola?\", \"Lovely, and do you know where that one was taken?\", \"On a different note, could you tell me what Ifeoma's surname is?\", \"Finally, would you please jot down a note that says ask Iskander about the cricket?\"], [\"open the Summer 2026 album\", \"wait quick one when's the cricket viewing\", \"ok back to the album, just stuff about viola\", \"where was that taken\", \"whats Ifeoma's last name\", \"make a note ask Iskander about the cricket\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0031\", \"v\": [[\"Do I have any photos of Viggo Nieminen, please?\", \"Could you tell me who's in it?\", \"I phoned Viggo earlier, would you mind logging that for me?\"], [\"I'm putting together a little birthday thing for my cousin, so do I have any photos of Viggo Nieminen in there?\", \"Oh nice, I don't remember that one at all, who else is in it with him?\", \"Actually that reminds me, I rang Viggo this morning about the birthday, so can you log that I phoned him?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0032\", \"v\": [[\"email Calla the Centre wifi\", \"what'd I pay for the night?\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\", \"fencing class wednesday at 9:30\"], [\"Would you please email Calla the Centre wifi details?\", \"Could you tell me what I paid for the night?\", \"Actually, never mind that, I'll have a look myself later.\", \"Could you please book in a fencing class on Wednesday at 9:30?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0033\", \"v\": [[\"whats the actual password for the router\"], [\"My laptop's forgotten the network again and the sticker on the box has totally faded, so could you tell me what the actual password for the router is?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w15-0034\", \"v\": [[\"Viola album photos\", \"which are favourites?\", \"wait, kapaet fee amount?\", \"back to album, hatchet one taken where?\"], [\"Could you show me the photos in the Viola album, please?\", \"Would you tell me which of those are favourites?\", \"Sorry, hang on, could you tell me how much the kapaet fee was?\", \"Thanks. Going back to the album, where was the hatchet one taken, please?\"]]}","ttft_ms":20507,"type":"result","duration_ms":20573,"uuid":"22244b79-e44e-4952-b485-1fef57cf1cb3","ttft_stream_ms":1333,"time_to_request_ms":123,"first_content_frame_ms":1333,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22088938,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278639299.7346,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
